config BR2_PACKAGE_HEVEA_BOOTSTRAP
	bool "Hevea Bootstrap"
	help
	  Install the Hevea bootstrap service that automatically
	  sets up the Hevea Apps repository and installs required
	  add-ons (Hevea Access Point, Hevea Onboarding App, Hevea OpenVPN).

	  This service runs once during first boot and creates a marker
	  file to prevent re-execution on subsequent boots.
